      en: ["Established on September 23, 1989, specifically for Magnolia pallescens.", "The total protected area covers 23.1 square kilometers.", "Elevations range from 800 meters to a peak of 1,565 meters.", "Source of significant regional rivers including Camú and Jimenoa.", "Home to 621 vascular plant species, with 153 endemic to Hispaniola.", "Annual precipitation levels reach up to 3,000 mm in the cloud forest."],
